<h2>Additional reported ALPR deployments.</h2>
<p>Public surveillance indexes identify additional ALPR deployments in McHenry, Lake in the Hills, Woodstock, Crystal Lake, and Johnsburg. These entries are supported here as secondary-source leads; underlying agency records are not included in the current source set.</p>
